We are looking for a Systems-minded Software Engineer to join our AI Solution Team. Unlike traditional application development, this role sits at the intersection of high-performance software engineering and AI orchestration. You will be responsible for building the core components that make our AI solutions fast, stable, and scalable.

Design and Develop robust frontend/backend components for AI products, with a focus on high-performance orchestration and seamless tool-integration;

Partner with Data Scientists to transform complex algorithms and mathematical models into production-ready, maintainable software;

Optimize for speed and build reliability into AI applications to handle real-world complexity.

Requirements

Being honest, humble, and a proactive learner;

Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field;

Programming skills with a deep sense of computation and complexity;

An Intuitive understanding of computation architecture;

Commitment to a disciplined approach and mindset for high standards for stability, robustness, and security;

Being familiar with Linux environment;

Interest in mass data manipulation and computational intense task is an advantage;

Familiarity with SQL or NoSQL databases is an advantage;

Experience with Cloud service such as AWS, Azure, GCP is an advantage;

Team spirit and proactive idea-sharing; fluent in both Chinese and English.




Interested candidates should send their CV with a 1-page cover letter outlining their expectations and relevant interests, stating current and expected salary, to rec••••@clustertech.com.

